#  Eye Mouse

Eye Mouse is an AI-based project that lets you control your computer mouse using your eyes.  
It uses computer vision and eye-tracking techniques to detect gaze direction and map it to cursor movements.  
This project aims to improve accessibility and provide hands-free interaction with computers.

---

## Features
- Control the mouse cursor using your eyes
- Smooth and real-time tracking
- Hands-free computer interaction
- Built with computer vision & machine learning
- Designed for accessibility and innovation

---

## 🛠Tech Stack
- **Programming Language**: Python  
- **Libraries**: OpenCV, dlib/mediapipe, pyautogui  
- **Hardware**: Standard webcam  
